  unitName: Water God
  unitId: 20204
  unitNumber: 259
  description: This subspecies of Metal God is said to hold within its massive body
    an enormous collection of information on the known world. Despite its shiny blue
    body leading many to think it's as cold as ice, it's really not that bad once
    you touch one. They also seem to like the look on peoples' faces when they realize
    this so they often call out to be touched. Though thanks to their rarity, when
    one says "Try and touch me," Summoners are quick to oblige.
  summonDesc: Do I look cold to you?<br>Hehe, try and touch me!<br>Come on! Touch
    me!
